### billing admin calls for VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client). Through the gateway with a STAFF JWT.
#
# 1. Get a staff token: log in as a user whose role is billing_admin (writes) or support (reads only):
#      POST {{gw}}/auth/login   -> copy "access_token" into @staff below (or put it in .vscode/settings.json under
#      "rest-client.environmentVariables": {"dev": {"staff": "<jwt>", ...}}).
# 2. Every WRITE needs an Idempotency-Key (a new UUID each time): {{$guid}} below does that.
# 3. Admin routes are /billing/admin/<path> at the gateway (-> /admin/billing/v1/<path> in billing).
#    Simulator routes are /billing/sim/<path>, only while the gateway has SIM_ROUTES on and billing runs PAYMENT_SIMULATION=true.

@gw = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@staff = <paste a staff JWT here>
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@paymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@draftId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@subId = sub_SIM_replace_me

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- accounts

### Search an account by email, name or id
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/accounts?q=asha@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### One account: plan, subscription, wallet, ledger, usage, overrides
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Block (a genuinely blocked account: fraud, chargeback)
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "chargeback on GA/2026/0001"}

### Unblock
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "resolved"}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- overrides (give a user a plan for a while)

### Grant Pro for 30 days
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/overrides
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"owner_type": "user", "owner_id": "{{userId}}", "plan_code": "pro", "expires_at": "2026-12-31T00:00:00+05:30", "reason": "support goodwill"}

### End an override early (use the override id from the account view)
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/overrides/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/end
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "ended early"}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- money

### Refund part of a payment (paise)
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"payment_id": "{{paymentId}}", "amount_paise": 10000, "reason": "duplicate charge"}

### Record a Razorpay settlement (fees in paise)
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"payment_id": "{{paymentId}}", "fee_paise": 200, "fee_gst_paise": 36, "reason": "settlement report"}

### Costs by plan (also: by=user for the 20 heaviest users, by=model, by=group)
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/costs?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30&by=plan
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### The 20 heaviest users
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/costs?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30&by=user
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Reconciliation for a day (every check must show difference 0)
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/reconciliation?date=2026-11-15
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Model prices and FX rates
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/model-prices
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

###
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/fx-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- plan catalog (draft -> preview -> publish)

### The active catalog (source: yaml or published draft) and plan version history
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Export it as plans.yaml
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/catalog/export.yaml
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Create a draft: paste the catalog as JSON (the plans.yaml schema). catalog_version MUST change. The answer is the PREVIEW:
### the diff (rises and falls), how many subscribers each change touches, and warnings.
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/catalog/drafts
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"note": "Plan lineup v3", "catalog": {"catalog_version": "CHANGE-ME", "currency": "INR", "gst_inclusive": true, "model_groups": {}, "plans": []}}

### List drafts / read one
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/catalog/drafts
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

###
GET {{gw}}/billing/admin/catalog/drafts/{{draftId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Publish the draft
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/catalog/drafts/{{draftId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "Plan lineup v3"}

### Apply LOWERED limits to existing subscribers (audit_id comes from the publish answer's apply_limits)
POST {{gw}}/billing/admin/catalog/apply-limits/15
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "apply the lower limits"}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- simulator controls (dev only)

### Everything the simulator holds
GET {{gw}}/billing/sim/state
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Charge the next renewal now / renew immediately
POST {{gw}}/billing/sim/subscriptions/{{subId}}/next-charge
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

###
POST {{gw}}/billing/sim/subscriptions/{{subId}}/renew-now
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### The customer cancels from the "bank" side
POST {{gw}}/billing/sim/subscriptions/{{subId}}/customer-cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

### Settle everything now / fail a refund
POST {{gw}}/billing/sim/settle-now
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}

###
POST {{gw}}/billing/sim/refunds/rfnd_SIM_replace_me/fail
Authorization: Bearer {{staff}}
